    row. Rows fade out with a mask well above the footer.
B - Pages become PS3 Settings screens on a new reusable XmbList (listbox
    semantics, hover anchoring, --row-offset/--item-scale geometry):
    SystemUtilities first (key/value rows, cursor row larger), then all
    page chrome stripped - no bordered cards, no pills, no decorative
    uppercase, Rodin everywhere except code blocks, diagrams frameless.
C - The destination description stacks under the title in one column
    (.console-destination-body, ~380px), same text shadow, no veil,
    'sub' on one line and the long detail behind the triangle menu.
D - Triangle options panel anchored at the right edge: Apri, Apri in una
    nuova scheda, Copia link, Informazioni (detail text); opened by the
    triangle, T or right-click, closed by o/Esc, arrows step the rows.
E - useGamepad polls per frame: d-pad 12-15, x select, o back, triangle
    options, L1/R1 across categories; one input = one step, hold pauses
    then repeats; clean rAF/listener teardown on unmount.
F - Wave sparkles ride the ribbon centre, ~2x density (290), faster
    irregular twinkle, a few larger motes with halos, star alpha 0.14-0.23,
    static under reduced motion.
G - Theme Settings in Settings and on its own screen: the 12 atmospheres
    plus Originale (monthly rotation), swatches, persisted in
    yag-xmb-theme-v1, read by monthlyPalette().
H - Submenus interpolate size/opacity by distance (selected 1.0,
    neighbours ~0.46-0.78, damped above the crossbar); the clock becomes
    an open bar toward the right edge with the closed 48px box kept
    behind --clock-box; menu rows fade before the footer; on small
    screens the footer is one line (wordmark+audio left, icons only
    right) and nothing reaches it.

